 "description": "Create a new contact in iCloud Contacts. Needs a givenName, familyName or organization; optional middleName, nickname, department, jobTitle, note, birthday (YYYY-MM-DD, or --MM-DD without a year), and lists of emails, phones, urls and postal addresses, each with an optional label (home, work, mobile, other or custom text). Returns the new contact's id and details as re-read from iCloud (verified). Requires ICLOUD_USERNAME + ICLOUD_APP_PASSWORD (an app-specific password). Available when APPLE_WRITE_MODE is additive or all.",
